{
    "title": "Burn Guide - dust",
    "description": "Going to Burning Man or a regional burn? You'll need to know what events are going on, what camps to visit and where to find the best art! Dust provides an offline experience make your burn awesome.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022 Find events by day, category, theme camp or search\r\n\u2022 Find art by search or listing\r\n\u2022 Find theme camps by search or listing\r\n\u2022 Map locations for Art and Theme Camps\r\n\u2022 Favorite events, Art and Theme Camps\r\n\u2022 Get notified when your favorite event is about to start\r\n\u2022 Find DJ Sets from Rock Star Librarian and get notified when a set starts\r\n\u2022 Works offline\r\n\r\nNote\r\nFor Burning Man this is an unofficial app with data source from innovate.burningman.org and www.rockstarlibrarian.com.\r\nLocation information is hidden until the event starts on Sunday.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Going to Burning Man or a regional burn? You&#39;ll need to know what events are going on, what camps to visit and where to find the best art! Dust provides an offline experience make your burn awesome.<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022 Find events by day, category, theme camp or search<br>\u2022 Find art by search or listing<br>\u2022 Find theme camps by search or listing<br>\u2022 Map locations for Art and Theme Camps<br>\u2022 Favorite events, Art and Theme Camps<br>\u2022 Get notified when your favorite event is about to start<br>\u2022 Find DJ Sets from Rock Star Librarian and get notified when a set starts<br>\u2022 Works offline<br><br>Note<br>For Burning Man this is an unofficial app with data source from innovate.burningman.org and www.rockstarlibrarian.com.<br>Location information is hidden until the event starts on Sunday.",
